{"id":"mtk-02e-konversi-pecahan-desimal-persen-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-02","subBab":"mtk-02e","slug":"konversi-pecahan-desimal-persen","tier":"campur","title":"OSN SD — Matematika Sub-Bab 02e","theory":[{"title":"A. Pecahan ↔ Desimal","content":"- **Pecahan → Desimal**: bagi pembilang dengan penyebut.\n  Contoh: 1/4 = 1 ÷ 4 = 0,25 ; 3/5 = 3 ÷ 5 = 0,6\n- **Desimal → Pecahan**: tulis desimal sebagai pembilang dengan penyebut 10 (1 angka di belakang koma), 100 (2 angka), 1000 (3 angka), lalu sederhanakan.\n  Contoh: 0,75 = 75/100 = 3/4 ; 0,4 = 4/10 = 2/5"},{"title":"B. Desimal ↔ Persen","content":"- **Desimal → Persen**: kalikan 100, tambah tanda %.\n  Contoh: 0,25 → 25% ; 0,07 → 7% ; 1,2 → 120%\n- **Persen → Desimal**: bagi 100, hapus tanda %.\n  Contoh: 45% → 0,45 ; 5% → 0,05 ; 150% → 1,5"},{"title":"C. Pecahan ↔ Persen","content":"- **Pecahan → Persen**: ubah ke desimal dulu lalu ×100, atau langsung kalikan 100%.\n  Contoh: 1/4 × 100% = 25% ; 3/20 × 100% = 15%\n- **Persen → Pecahan**: tulis sebagai per-100, sederhanakan.\n  Contoh: 60% = 60/100 = 3/5"},{"title":"D. Tabel Hafalan Wajib","content":"| Pecahan | Desimal | Persen |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| 1/2     | 0,5     | 50%    |\n| 1/4     | 0,25    | 25%    |\n| 3/4     | 0,75    | 75%    |\n| 1/5     | 0,2     | 20%    |\n| 2/5     | 0,4     | 40%    |\n| 3/5     | 0,6     | 60%    |\n| 4/5     | 0,8     | 80%    |\n| 1/8     | 0,125   | 12,5%  |\n| 3/8     | 0,375   | 37,5%  |\n| 5/8     | 0,625   | 62,5%  |\n| 7/8     | 0,875   | 87,5%  |\n| 1/10    | 0,1     | 10%    |\n| 1/20    | 0,05    | 5%     |\n| 1/3     | 0,333…  | 33,33% |\n| 2/3     | 0,666…  | 66,67% |"},{"title":"E. Aplikasi","content":"- **Diskon**: harga akhir = harga awal × (100% − diskon).\n- **Bunga sederhana**: bunga = pokok × persen × waktu.\n- **Statistik**: 1/5 siswa = 20% siswa."},{"title":"F. Kesalahan Umum (Hindari!)","content":"1. Lupa ×100 saat ubah desimal ke persen (mis. 0,25 → 0,25% ❌, seharusnya 25%).\n2. Koma salah geser (0,75 dianggap 7,5%).\n3. Persen >100 dianggap pecahan biasa <1.\n4. Tidak menyederhanakan pecahan akhir.\n5. Salah hitung desimal berulang 1/3 = 0,3 (seharusnya 0,333…).\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk desimal dari pecahan 1/4 adalah …","options":{"A":"0,25","B":"0,14","C":"0,4","D":"0,5"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk persen dari 0,3 adalah …","options":{"A":"30%","B":"0,3%","C":"3%","D":"300%"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"50% jika ditulis sebagai pecahan paling sederhana adalah …","options":{"A":"1/2","B":"5/10","C":"50/100","D":"1/50"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk desimal dari 75% adalah …","options":{"A":"7,5","B":"0,075","C":"0,75","D":"75,0"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Pecahan 3/5 senilai dengan persen …","options":{"A":"30%","B":"35%","C":"53%","D":"60%"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk pecahan dari 0,8 adalah …","options":{"A":"8/10 (atau 4/5)","B":"8/100","C":"1/8","D":"80/10"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTopic":"TINGKAT KABUPATEN (Soal 1","level":"Kab","question":"1/2 jika diubah menjadi persen adalah …","options":{"A":"12%","B":"20%","C":"25%","D":"50%"},"answerKe